  "remarks": "TAi.019 Title: Maulavi. Designation: Deputy Minister of Commerce of the Taliban regime. Leads a commission to register enemies of the Taliban as of mid-2013. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Belongs to Nurzai tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 27 Jul. 2010.; Listing: Listed on 31 January 2001 (amended on 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov 2011, 13 Aug 2012, 19 October 2012 and 31 Dec. 2013)",
